  "description": "<p><strong>Houses of Parliament Entry Ticket and Audio Guide</strong> offers a self-guided audio tour of the Houses of Parliament in London, providing a comprehensive narration about its history and political processes.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Ticket types</strong><br>\n🎫 Adult (12+)<br>\n🎫 Child (3-11)</p>\n\n<p><strong>Highlights</strong><br>\n🎧 Enjoy an audio tour of the Houses of Parliament in London, on your own terms<br>\n🏰 Marvel at the Parliament building's exterior, featuring dazzling golden spires and majestic statues that shine in the Thames<br>\n🗣️ Tune in to a 75-minute commentary on the political workings and history of the Houses of Parliament</p>\n\n<p><strong>General Info</strong><br>\n📅 Date and time: various dates and times are available (select during purchase)<br>\n⏳ Duration: 75 minutes<br>\n📍 Location:&nbsp;Houses of Parliament: St. Margaret St., SW1A 0AA London<br>\n- Meeting Point: Abbey Shop, Official Souvenirs Shop of Westminster Abbey<br>\n👤 Age requirement: All ages are welcome. A child under 14 must be accompanied by an adult<br>\n❗ For this event, all sales are final and tickets can’t be refunded, changed or modified. For more information, please refer to our <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/e/2PACX-1vSVRJ1Z5-8gFm17oKLfc1rcA_HQk0tfJdZ8J4EOwBjPOBrfX-AvXaaGoq7vPNos-r2V4U4PxCfXUyar/pub\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">T&amp;Cs</a></p>\n\n<p><strong>Description</strong><br>\nEmbark on a thrilling adventure as you uncover the secrets of London's iconic Houses of Parliament like never before! Dive into its rich history and political intricacies with an exciting 75-minute audio tour, immersing yourself in the stunning facade of this magnificent landmark. Choose from nine languages for a personalized experience, and enjoy the accessibility that makes it inclusive for everyone. What's more, your entry ticket is already included! Don't miss this golden opportunity to explore and be captivated by one of London's most iconic attractions. Book now and let the excitement unfold!</p>",
